# Whitelist mode: ignore everything, then allow only wanted files.

# 1. Ignore everything
*

# 2. But descend into directories so allowed files below can match
!*/

# 3. Allow source files (anywhere in tree)
!.gitignore
!lecture.pptx
!canton-report.qmd
!swiss_cantons_dummy.csv
!render_all_cantons.R
!README.md
!/LICENSE
!_extensions/**
!.claude/skills/swisstph-quarto-starter/**
!Agenda.md
!*.Rproj

# 4. Allow exercises folder, including the solution subfolder
!exercises/**
exercises/report-starter.pdf
exercises/report-starter.docx
exercises/report-starter.html
exercises/.Rhistory
.Rproj.user
exercises/report-starter_files
exercises/report-instructions.qmd
